MATHEMATICAL NOTES
-----------------

1. B-spline Recursion (Cox-de Boor):
   
   N_{i,0}(t) = 1 if t_{i} ≤ t < t_{i+1}, else 0
   
   N_{i,j}(t) = (t - t_i)/(t_{i+j} - t_i) · N_{i,j-1}(t) + 
                (t_{i+j+1} - t)/(t_{i+j+1} - t_{i+1}) · N_{i+1,j-1}(t)

2. PCHIP Hermite Basis:
   
   H₁(s) = 1 - 3s² + 2s³
   H₂(s) = 3s² - 2s³
   H₃(s) = s(s-1)² h
   H₄(s) = s²(s-1) h
   
   where s = (x - x_i) / h, h = x_{i+1} - x_i

3. Centripetal Parameterization:
   
   u_i = Σ_{k=1}^{i} √(Δx_k² + Δy_k²) / Σ√(Δx_k² + Δy_k²)
   
   Better than uniform (u_i = i/n) for varying curvature

